Third-party notices for the Specrun map skill
=============================================

The rendering approach used by this skill — a single self-contained HTML file built around an
inline SVG with a viewBox, a row of summary cards beneath the diagram, an export toolbar that
collapses to one control, and the discipline of keeping font sizes small and fixed so a dense
diagram stays legible — is adapted from the `architecture-diagram` skill in
Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator.

The visual language is not adapted from it. Palette, typography, card design and connector style
come from `design/map-reference.md` in the Specrun repository, which records the design of an
earlier Electron prototype. No Cocoon markup, stylesheet or example diagram is reproduced here.

